    "description": "Set along the beach and overlooked by mountains, this upscale, all-inclusive resort is 9 km from Bijao Golf Club and 12 km from Playa Santa Clara, a picturesque beach.\nThe relaxed rooms come with flat-screen TVs, CD players, free Wi-Fi, and tea and coffemakers. They have balconies or terraces with ocean, garden or mountain views. Minifridges are available (fee). Upgraded rooms and suites add lounges. Room service is on offer.\nBreakfast and parking are free. There are multiple dining options, including a beach bar and a Japanese eatery. Other amenities include a gym, outdoor pools, a game room and a spa, plus sports facilities and a kids' club."
